        "Content": "Impressive 6 Bedroom Bungalow \r\n\r\n- Stone Fronted  \r\n- 5km from City\r\n- Private & Mature Site\r\n- South Facing Garden\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION COMPRISES:\r\nEntrance Hall\t\t\t4.6m x 2m\t\tTiled, Ornate Cornicing \r\nLivingroom \t\t\t5m x 4m\t\tWell-lit dual aspect room, wood floor, stove, cornicing\r\nKitchen/ Dining Room\t9m x 4m\t\tQuality Cabinetry, Integrated Appliances, feature brick\r\n                                                                                            Fireplace with inset stove, French doors to large balcony \r\n                                                                                    Overlooking garden.\r\nUtility       \t\t\t2m x 1.5m\t\tTiled & Fitted \t\r\nMaster Bedroom\t\t9m x 5m\t\tVaulted ceiling, Walkin dressing room, spacious ensuite, \t\t\t\t\t\t\tfeature window overlooking garden.\t\t\r\nBedroom (2) \t\t\t5m x 3.5m\t\tEnsuite, Fitted wardrobe, Carpet \r\nBedroom (3) \t\t\t4m x 3m\t             Wood Floor, fitted wardrobe\r\nBedroom (4) \t\t\t3.5m x 3m\t             Wood Floor, Fitted Wardrobe\r\nBedroom (5) \t\t\t4.5m x 4m\t             Carpet, Fitted Wardrobe\r\nBedroom (6) \t\t\t4m x 4m\t             Carpet\r\nMain Bathroom \t\t4.5m x 2.5m       \r\n             \t\r\nOutside: Large wrap around balcony overlooking garden, mature lawns & shrubberies front & rear, Garden Shed.\r\nFeatures: South facing garden, triple glazed windows, limestone cills, oil fired central heating, alarm, high level of décor."
